==English==
{{wikipedia}}

===Alternative spellings===
* [[seatbelt]]

===Noun===
{{en-noun|sg=[[seat]] [[belt]]}}

# A restraining belt attached to a vehicle seat which is fastened around [[passenger]]s and which is intended to keep an [[occupant]] in place so as to avoid injuries in accidents where the occupant could be thrown against a solid object.

